                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "531ed0c3-6fa1-4098-bbeb-7ac06a6e373b",
                        "source_entry_id": "bb0fa513-d9e2-3950-b429-be29f209edf5",
                        "source_sense_id": "287dc504-c7f7-39a6-8a7f-7b7477dbb8a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "clusterfuck",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "clusterfuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                        "entry_id": "2ea1f93e-7cfd-32d2-94c3-16ce8685a56b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chaotic situation where everything seems to go wrong, often caused by communication failure, a complex environment, or incompetence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "slang",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2f21013-d2d4-4f5d-8968-2727d9da471e",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "[Colonel Meyers:] That's for sure. What's your assessment of this exercise? [Highway:] It's a cluster fuck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa23bc2b-96ab-44af-9166-d01eee0f8368",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "1989: P. J. O'Rourke, Holidays in Hell\n\"Mongolian Cluster Fuck\" is the technical term journalists use for a preplanned, wholly scripted, news-free event."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "254d1317-3cd5-40c1-8f5c-023d40c6f86c",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "They had a name for something like this in the army—a cluster fuck. Yes. Good name. ... He was sitting here in the middle of a great big cluster fuck"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26537f4-7b76-4763-9dc9-b44ea513b636",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "A simple sweep-and-clear turned into a total clusterfuck: T-Bird, trying to explain to Eric how the situation escalated on Devil's Night […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "346fc1df-ad66-4530-8409-55e92aeb5350",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "Please note also my request that henceforth I wish to be reminded of the possibility of a clusterfuck in any contingency plan or operations proposal […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4895bb8c-22ef-4c12-b783-3dbfaad62f12",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "My cousin was in the Army over here in '68. He says don't trust anybody to know what they're doing, calls it a cluster-fuck. Fucked-up-beyond-all-repair, FUBAR he says."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "659f8817-21ea-416f-abbc-04ed85bdd44b",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "[…] and you will still only begin to get a sense of the constitutionally mandated clusterfuck that is the modern presidency."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fc6aa78-6f97-4b43-85dd-3efe38fb6446",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "It was a clusterfuck, a deadly clusterfuck. When the doughs finally got off the ground in some numbers and charged into the woods, the Krauts broke contact […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4041b328-304b-4618-88ed-068c9df92b66",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "[CIA-Superior:] Okay. Okay. If he wakes up we'll worry about it then. Jesus, what a clusterfuck."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9421d38-8ae6-46cb-abfa-db4290fef0b8",
                                                "sense_id": "456e15d8-9a16-3692-b525-655c8f8a4a81",
                                                "text": "2013: Barbara Kruger: What a ridiculous clusterfuck of totally uncool jokers. I make my work about this kind of sadly foolish farce. I’m waiting for all of them to sue me for copyright infringement in response to the Supreme v Married To The Mob battle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a033bd2-d624-3079-95c1-4aaf4813d43c",
                                        "entry_id": "2ea1f93e-7cfd-32d2-94c3-16ce8685a56b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sexual orgy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "clusterfuck",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1de58d7f-c4ae-33db-b0de-7baf7ea615bc",
